  <section>
    <h2>Behaviour in Amstelvar Avar2</h2>
    <p>
      Amstelvar Avar2 implements XSHA through separate serif-width axes for
      uppercase, lowercase, and figures. The transformation expands or
      contracts horizontal serif projections while preserving their attachment
      to the stem and their role in the overall construction.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Straight construction — H</h2>
    <p>
      H is a useful control: the horizontal serifs change in width while the
      stems, crossbar, and main proportions remain stable.
    </p>

